### The presets of the person (scene/presets/pagePresets.ts).

preset-command-save = Save as a preset
preset-command-remove = Remove a preset
preset-arg-entity = The entity ID (default: the selected entity).
preset-arg-component = The component of a component preset (default: the whole entity, with no transform).
preset-arg-name = The name of the preset.
preset-arg-preset = The ID of the preset.
preset-ask-title = Save as a preset
preset-ask-label = The name of the preset
preset-ask-cancelled = No preset was saved.
preset-no-entity = Select an entity first.
preset-none = No preset has this ID.
preset-not-kept = The browser storage did not keep the preset.
